			"config": {
				"register": "shillinq",
				"schema": "Werknemer",
				"_note": "MASTER record (employee). Werknemer is a person, but the payroll schema declares NO email/calendar linkedType — an employee here is a payroll subject, not a correspondent — so no comms leaves. The body pairs the employment/tax-table/salary data with the employee's own payslip history (LoonStrook filtered on werknemerId), the single most-consulted view when answering an employee's pay question. Audit trail sidebar for changes to salary/tax-credit settings.",
